{"items":[{"id":"d67a27aa-8233-45f3-a273-31f8476b642a","title":"This video features a food spot in Melaka","vendor":"Coconut Shake Batu Berendam","platform":"TikTok","location":"Melaka","dishes":["Coconut Shake"],"recommendation":"Highly Recommended","score":5,"status":"DRAFT","sourceVideoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@melakafoodandtravel/video/7599119102703062292","summary":"This video features a food spot in Melaka. The influencer is reviewing Coconut Shake Batu Berendam, a popular eatery that has been serving coconut shakes since 1988. The key highlight mentioned is the unique and refreshing coconut shake, made with 7,000 coconuts per month, which is carefully controlled to ensure the perfect flavor and texture. The influencer highly recommends this eatery, stating that it is the best in Melaka, and encourages viewers to try it out. Overall, the sentiment is extremely positive, with the influencer praising the quality and uniqueness of the coconut shake.","priceRange":"RM10-20 per person","lastUpdated":"2026-07-28T13:58:23.080399+00:00"},{"id":"dbbcba9a-4b4d-4779-bfc2-1fe6eae603f1","title":"This video features a food spot in Melaka","vendor":"Bak Korea","platform":"TikTok","location":"Melaka Raya","dishes":["Korean Hok Spicy","Korean Bulldog Frak Rai","Nongshim Shim Ramayun","Korean Hok Spicy Chicken Choc","Korean Hok Spicy Chicken Burger"],"recommendation":"Highly Recommended","score":4.5,"status":"ACTIVE","sourceVideoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@melakafoodiee/video/7514859885419334920","summary":"This video features a food spot in Melaka. The eatery being reviewed is Bak Korea, a Korean restaurant that offers a variety of spicy dishes. Key highlights mentioned include the restaurant's peaceful ambiance, nostalgic murals, and a range of must-try dishes such as Korean Hok Spicy (chicken with Korean sauce), Korean Bulldog Frak Rai (spicy fried rice with chicken), and Nongshim Shim Ramayun (a type of Korean noodle soup). Overall, the influencer highly recommends Bak Korea, especially for those in Melaka who are looking for a unique dining experience.","priceRange":"RM 10 - RM 25 per person","lastUpdated":"2026-07-26T12:11:53.831+00:00"},{"id":"c8115469-fae5-4598-b068-a54df42402d2","title":"This video features a food spot in Melaka","vendor":"Restoran Kok Keong","platform":"TikTok","location":"Melaka","dishes":["Rice Mungkak"],"recommendation":"Highly Recommended","score":4.5,"status":"ACTIVE","sourceVideoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@melakafoodandtravel/video/7558289723689635090","summary":"This video features a food spot in Melaka. The eatery being reviewed is Restoran Kok Keong, a renowned restaurant in the city that has been serving traditional dishes since 1933. The key highlight mentioned is the restaurant's signature dish, rice mungkak, which is a flavorful rice dish containing mungkak (a type of red bean). The influencer praises the dish, stating that it is delicious and worth trying. Overall, the recommendation is positive, suggesting that Restoran Kok Keong is a must-visit destination for food enthusiasts in Melaka.","priceRange":"RM 10 - RM 20 per person","lastUpdated":"2026-07-18T17:34:25.591+00:00"},{"id":"96e31e2a-dce5-4735-9472-a68d2082dd55","title":"This video features a food spot in Kuala Lumpur, specifically located at Jongke Walk","vendor":"2Mes","platform":"TikTok","location":"Malacca","dishes":["Specialty Local Dishes"],"recommendation":"Highly Recommended","score":4.5,"status":"ACTIVE","sourceVideoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@diarimelaka/video/7472963258643746056","summary":"This video features a food spot in Kuala Lumpur, specifically located at Jongke Walk. The eatery being reviewed is 2MES, a Malay restaurant that serves traditional Malaysian dishes. Key highlights mentioned include the restaurant's high rating, with over 300 reviews and a 5-star average, as well as the chef's attention to quality and customer satisfaction, with many customers praising the taste and value for money. Overall, the influ