. Key highlights mentioned include the restaurant's ability to maintain its original taste quality, the addition of a new Korean sauce option, and affordable prices, with ice cream starting from 75 sen (approximately USD 0.18) and mix ice cream at RM 3 (approximately USD 0.70). The influencer concludes by encouraging viewers to support local brands and bring their families to try the restaurant's offerings. Overall, the review is positive, with the influencer expressing enthusiasm for the restaurant's new additions and recommending it to their audience.","priceRange":"RM 3 - RM 13 per person","lastUpdated":"2026-07-16T13:41:00.315+00:00"},{"id":"8a43ec57-a567-49aa-93bd-811fa66181b5","title":"Classic and famous Hainanese chicken rice ball shop located on Jonker Street","vendor":"Famosa Chicken Rice Ball","platform":"TikTok","location":"28","dishes":["Chicken Rice Balls","Roasted Chicken"],"recommendation":"Highly Recommended","score":4.5,"status":"ACTIVE","sourceVideoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@melakafoodiee/video/7607323503792065810","summary":"Classic and famous Hainanese chicken rice ball shop located on Jonker Street.","priceRange":"RM 10 - RM 20 per person","lastUpdated":"2026-07-16T13:40:49.271+00:00"}],"pagination":{"page":1,"pageSize":8,"total":602,"totalPages":76}}
